### Demo requests for the Team 6 backend.
### Open in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension, then click "Send Request" above a block.
### Start the backend first:  cd backend  ->  .\mvnw.cmd spring-boot:run

@base = http://localhost:8086/api
@user = u_demo

### 0. (Optional) Start from an empty database
DELETE {{base}}/demo/reset

### 1. Fake a whole journey: sends all 7 notification types. Copy the "pnr" from the reply into @pnr below.
POST {{base}}/demo/journey?userId={{user}}

### 2. Unread count: what the bell icon polls (should be 7)
GET {{base}}/notifications/user/{{user}}/unread-count

### 3. The user's notifications, newest first
GET {{base}}/notifications/user/{{user}}

### 4. What the other teams must send for each type
GET {{base}}/notifications/types

### 5. Send one notification by hand, the way another team would
POST {{base}}/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "BOOKING_CONFIRMED",
  "userId": "{{user}}",
  "pnr": "4567891234",
  "sourceTeam": "team-2",
  "eventTime": "2026-10-21T14:30:00",
  "data": {
    "trainNumber": "12301",
    "trainName": "Rajdhani Express",
    "journeyDate": "2026-12-15",
    "fromStation": "NDLS",
    "toStation": "BCT",
    "travelClass": "3A",
    "passengerCount": 2,
    "bookingStatus": "CNF"
  }
}

### 6. Same, but with a field missing: shows the 400 error message
POST {{base}}/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "WL_TO_RAC",
  "userId": "{{user}}",
  "pnr": "4567891234",
  "sourceTeam": "team-2",
  "eventTime": "2026-10-21T14:30:00",
  "data": { "passengerName": "Rahul Kumar" }
}

### 7. Mark everything as read (bell stops blinking)
PATCH {{base}}/notifications/user/{{user}}/read-all

# ---------------- Feedback ----------------
# Paste the pnr from step 1 here:
@pnr = 9530993942

### 8. Feedback form: journey details for the top card
GET {{base}}/feedback/form?userId={{user}}&pnr={{pnr}}

### 9. Submit feedback (foodQuality left out = "not applicable")
POST {{base}}/feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{user}}",
  "pnr": "{{pnr}}",
  "ratings": {
    "washroomCleanliness": 6,
    "coachCleaning": 6,
    "electricalAppliances": 3,
    "seatMaterialQuality": 7,
    "bedsheetBlanket": 8
  },
  "comment": "AC was too cold."
}

### 10. Submit again: 409 Conflict (only one feedback per journey)
POST {{base}}/feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{user}}",
  "pnr": "{{pnr}}",
  "ratings": { "washroomCleanliness": 9, "coachCleaning": 9, "electricalAppliances": 9,
               "seatMaterialQuality": 9, "bedsheetBlanket": 9 }
}

### 11. Average ratings: all trains, then one train
GET {{base}}/feedback/summary

###
GET {{base}}/feedback/summary?trainNumber=12301

### 12. Admin: every notification ever received
GET {{base}}/notifications/log
